    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2Cso4WAZSWbQutHMvcAniFJ)_\n\n## What\n\nThe nightly tidy for the PRs merged since last night: #296, #297, #300, #302, #303.\n\n- **Feature sets (Emacs)**: #300 and #302 (file notes into subfolders by tag, remove Denote, fold into `sp-notes`) in \"Notes vault tools\"; #303 (README module tables) in \"Module docs and layout\".\n- **Being developed**: \"Filing notes by tag, without Denote\" is gone (both PRs merged). The keymap line now lists #296 and #297 as merged; it stays because later keymap PRs are planned and #284, #294 and #296 are labelled needs-further-testing.\n- **Root `CHANGELOG.org`**: the i3 and sway part of #296 (Caps Lock as Level 3 shift, `$mod` is Mod5) in \"One layer key for window managers\".\n- **Module docs**: new \"Changes by pull request\" section in `sp-notes` (#300, #302) and an entry for #303 in `README.org`, in the nested-bullet format.\n\n## Left out on purpose\n\n- #125 and #171 are the only open PRs; their lines are unchanged.\n- #301 was the previous tidy.\n\nOnly prose changed, no code blocks, so the `tangle` check should be unaffected.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG)_",
