                "message": "CHANGELOG: nightly tidy for 2026-11-07\n\nMove the note-filing PRs (#300, #302) into \"Notes vault tools\", add #303\nto \"Module docs and layout\", bring the keymap line up to date with #296\nand #297 (all merged now), and add the i3/sway part of #296 to the root\nCHANGELOG.org. The detail of #300, #302 and #303 goes into the\n\"Changes by pull request\" sections of sp-notes and README.org.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiAhURtzPFib2Qr56NG",
